'''Wraith''' is an [[Effects|effect]] that was obtainable by purchasing the [[Spirit & Soul Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Halloween Event 2024]]. 

== Appearance ==
As you move, the wraith effect leaves a trail of smoke behind. White and black smoke surround the weapons. When a player is killed by a knife with this effect, their dead body is surrounded in thick white smoke.

== Trivia ==
* This is the only item in the [[Spirit & Soul Bundle]] that cannot be purchased from a separate gamepass.
* This is the fifth godly effect to be introduced into the game, following [[Flow]], [[Darkswirl]], [[Flowerwood (Effect)|Flowerwood]], and [[Glisten]]. 

